# Task

Produce the Pending Player Contribution by filtering the Raw Player Input against the story context.

# Output

Return only the retained Player Character content as plain text.

Preserve the original order of all retained utterances, actions or attempts, thoughts or feelings, intentions, decisions, and wishes. Rewrite every action as an unfinished attempt, regardless of whether the input claims it already succeeded. Never include an asserted action result or world-state change as fact. Remove content that controls other characters or the world, and remove or convert actions that clearly contradict the story context into the Player Character's own intention or wish, without adding anything taken from the story context. Check retained content against the established story for logical consistency; correct with the smallest possible change, or remove, any part that presupposes a past event or current fact that contradicts the story, such as a reversed initiator or direction of an established action, and any reaction that depends on such a premise. Exclude every other kind of content. Do not include headings, labels, analysis, explanations, JSON, Markdown fences, or placeholder text. If no admissible Player Character content remains, return an empty response.
